{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16144","headline":"昭应李郎中见贻佳作次韵奉酬 · 王建","name":"昭应李郎中见贻佳作次韵奉酬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窗户风凉四面开，陶公爱晚上高台。\n中庭不热青山入，野水初晴白鸟来。\n静思道心缘境熟，麤疎文字见诗回。\n诸生围遶新篇读，玉阙仙宫少此才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}